@zoneId = PASTE_ZONE_ID_HERE
@hoursId = PASTE_HOURS_ID_HERE


### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  8. ADMIN DELIVERY — ZONES  (all require admin JWT)
###
###  Edits the same `deliveryzones` table checkout prices from.
###  A pincode may belong to only one zone (409 otherwise).
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 8a. List All Zones
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/zones
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 8b. Create Zone
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/zones
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "locationName": "Guduvanchery",
  "pincodes": ["603202", "603210"],
  "deliveryCharge": 60,
  "freeDeliveryAbove": 500,
  "estimatedHours": 1
}

###

### 8c. Create Zone — checkout defaults for fee / threshold / ETA
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/zones
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "locationName": "Guindy",
  "pincodes": ["600032"]
}

###

### 8d. Update Zone  (paste id into @zoneId above)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/zones/{{zoneId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "deliveryCharge": 40,
  "freeDeliveryAbove": 750
}

###

### 8e. Delete Zone
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/zones/{{zoneId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###


### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  9. ADMIN DELIVERY — HOURS  (all require admin JWT)
###
###  Two entry types:
###    dayOfWeek   0=Sun 1=Mon 2=Tue 3=Wed 4=Thu 5=Fri 6=Sat
###    overrideDate  "YYYY-MM-DD"  (beats weekly schedule)
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 9a. Get All Hours (weekly schedule + overrides)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/hours
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 9b. Set Monday Hours
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/hours
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "dayOfWeek": 1,
  "openTime": "09:00",
  "closeTime": "21:00"
}

###

### 9c. Set Sunday as Closed
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/hours
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "dayOfWeek": 0,
  "openTime": "00:00",
  "closeTime": "00:00",
  "isClosed": true
}

###

### 9d. Add a Holiday Override (date-specific)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/hours
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "overrideDate": "2026-11-01",
  "openTime": "00:00",
  "closeTime": "00:00",
  "isClosed": true,
  "note": "Diwali — shop closed"
}

###

### 9e. Add Extended Hours Override
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/hours
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "overrideDate": "2026-10-31",
  "openTime": "08:00",
  "closeTime": "23:00",
  "note": "Halloween special — extended hours"
}

###

### 9f. Update an Hours Entry  (paste id into @hoursId above)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/hours/{{hoursId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "openTime": "10:00",
  "closeTime": "22:00"
}

###

### 9g. Delete an Hours Entry / Override
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery/hours/{{hoursId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
